      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "toilet_clogging_problem",
      "label": "Common household plumbing problem",
      "description": "The meme references a universally relatable frustration: a toilet that refuses to flush due to a clog. This is a common, everyday issue in households worldwide, often caused by foreign objects, excessive toilet paper, or buildup. Understanding this requires real-world knowledge of household plumbing and the common experience of dealing with clogged toilets.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
