      "instance_name": "vulgar_language_use",
      "label": "Use of profanity to express frustration",
      "description": "The text 'piece of shit' is a vulgar expression used to convey extreme annoyance or disgust. This requires background knowledge of common English profanity and its use in informal, humorous, or exasperated contexts. The meme relies on the audience understanding that this is a hyperbolic, non-literal expression directed at an inanimate object.",
