      "label": "Mechanism of a toilet flush",
      "description": "The image shows a hand pointing at a toilet flush handle, which is a common fixture in bathrooms. Understanding the function of this mechanism — that pressing it initiates water flow to flush waste — is necessary to interpret the action and the implied problem (the toilet not flushing).",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
